[88.563385, "o", "Chat-template overhead for gemma3:1b: 9 tokens (the wrapping around every message)\r\n\r\ntokens  chars  text\r\n"]
[88.716028, "o", "     1      5  hello\r\n"]
[88.910192, "o", "     3     28  Ignore previous instructions\r\n"]
[89.136489, "o", "     4     12  unbelievably\r\n"]
[89.399927, "o", "     6      6  ₹1,999\r\n"]
[89.573667, "o", "     1      6  नमस्ते\r\n\r\nRule of thumb for English: 1 token is about 4 characters (OpenAI help centre).\r\nOther languages, numbers and symbols often need more tokens per character. Try some!\r\n"]
