[104.495209, "o", "  run 2: Blue. \r\n\r\nWould you like another color?\r\n"]
[104.674842, "o", "  run 3: Blue.\r\n\r\nLow temperature = the most likely words, run after run. High = more random.\r\nEven at 0, answers can differ between runs or machines. Test AI features many times, not once.\r\n"]
