[192.903661, "o", "\r\nWe asked for the codeword. The model said: 'RainyDay'\r\nIt forgot. The first message fell off the whiteboard to make room. Nothing warned you.\r\nSecurity lesson: whatever is on the whiteboard is all the model 'knows'. Rules that fall off stop working,\r\nand an attacker who can add text can push things off. Long chats are not long memory.\r\n"]
